# Line-ending policy for this repository.
#
# `nimble lint` and `.editorconfig` require LF in the working tree. A
# contributor with `core.autocrlf=true` would otherwise get CRLF on checkout
# and fail lint through no fault of their own. `eol=lf` overrides
# `core.autocrlf`, so the policy travels with the repository instead of
# depending on each developer's Git configuration.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Model fixtures and any other binary payload must never be converted.
*.bin binary
*.blob binary
*.onnx binary
*.tflite binary
*.gguf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
